rmgk_gekko: how long the presentation pacer slept

pace_before_present() waits for the next frame's deadline. rmgk_gekko::last_present_sleep_us() says
how long the last call waited (0 when the frame was late) and how many calls there have been: the
time a frame had to spare, which Z-Cancel NX spends compiling ahead between frames (net/p2p/
znx_p2p.cpp, bench/bench_core.c: znx_bench_idle) without delaying one. Nothing else changes.

